    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72743.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "With regard to trade, it seems to have become a polar issue. Those who are absolutely supporting the administration and its hard-line stance toward Canada and especially now China and others that are very concerned about this trade agenda. Where does Senator Pat Roberts stand on that? And where do you think your Senate Ag Committee stands on this?",
