      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that trade policy is important enough to warrant public scrutiny and discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The administration’s hard-line trade stance is widely recognized and debated.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
