    "turn_text": "Well, I don't know. That question was asked if, in fact, We go with more in terms of tariffs. And what does that get you? I can say right off the bat that we started in with washing machines and solar panels. Boom, this organ market went to you nowhere. And they've never recovered. And you just keep on going down the list. The mitigation payments help. But we've always said we want trade not aid. So I'd be pretty careful of that given the pension that China seems to have to come back with retaliation.",
